  "method": "Each FL benchmark is matched to the closest standard(s) in each state by reading both texts. Empty list = no close match in that state. Built week by week as G5 weeks are sparkled; week 19 codes first; week 20 added R.1.1 and C.1.3; week 21 added R.1.2 and C.1.5; week 22 added R.3.1; week 23 added R.3.2 and EE.3.1; week 24 added R.2.4 and R.3.3.",
